{"title":"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2024 AMC 10B #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">2024 AMC 12B #4</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Balls numbered 1, 2, 3, ... are deposited in 5 bins, labeled A, B, C, D, and E, using the following procedure. Ball 1 is deposited in bin A, and balls 2 and 3 are deposited in bin B. The next 3 balls are deposited in bin C, the next 4 in bin D, and so on, cycling back to bin A after balls are deposited in bin E. (For example, balls numbered 22, 23, ..., 28 are deposited in bin B at step 7 of this process.) In which bin is ball 2024 deposited?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/4/a84a81ba63d8708a688c871f753461c2975ee565.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } A \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } B \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } C \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } D \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"382\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the triangular array of numbers:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c083dd559771e8de90399d77a028e339c7a7f7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1\\]\" width=\"6\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/e/8ae07c1f25096946a7cff66784d7924f47a3abc4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2, 3\\]\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/8/ff8dcb8d3ac03f8b2c48bce6582d624c389ee296.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4, 5, 6\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/d/44d97050255659ad9ce8a081f51cd6cd2174ca91.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7, 8, 9, 10\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/8/d8845f6caa2fc968b31e676455daed892ffbc89b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[11, 12, 13, 14, 15\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/4/76403adfdd35fb846675aaeaac92daec680a4fba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\vdots\\]\" width=\"2\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The numbers in a row congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/8/9486663ef8a76012bcf780e8abe2af248b13f84a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\bmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" /> will be in bucket A. Similarly, the numbers in a row congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/2/972ee7a638cbcafcbf40138bdaa2d6bab6667071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2, 3, 4, 0 \\bmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"18\" /> will be in buckets B, C, D, and E respectively. Note that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/3657b37b69a5e1029f9182897c6b5dc7492cc1bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^\\text{th}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> row ends with the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/5/3657b37b69a5e1029f9182897c6b5dc7492cc1bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^\\text{th}$\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> triangle number, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f8070867b03b0dc224db7e741135e07f4502c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>We must find values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> that make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/f/64f8070867b03b0dc224db7e741135e07f4502c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> close to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a78f43250219436b82de09ab2b2ad958b732b4c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{n(n+1)}{2} \\approx 2024\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea704a22c5ad8d061f2052674da8fa083ea6b43b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n(n+1) \\approx 4048\\]\" width=\"126\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/8/be8be73ee09c4442f9c33f5fd76323896980467a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n^2 \\approx 4048\\]\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/4/5946edb647f7db76bf3f643331c2dc46e0ba69f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n \\approx 63\\]\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Trying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/3/70323bd0f8ff191867325badf0632fcf37349adc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 63$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/a/0fa2e2d8ebc41da159cf9f0b4693f6926a782956.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2} = 2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b781fdf1cd172b567be38e2ffa6f20f0b8390c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2016$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> will be the last ball in row <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, ball <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> will be in row <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4d46d02ed33d39edd72205ed5ca6079d2e59d77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64 \\equiv 4 \\bmod{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />, ball <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5711c8d31d3bc3119aba377c9bda0f9dfb14e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2024$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> will be placed in bucket <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/513cabb9b6507deb0ef65d978ce50ffadc1706e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D. } D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"52\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~numerophilee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/11/2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg/600px-2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"849\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/11/2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg/900px-2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/1/11/2024_AMC_12B_P04.jpeg 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>~Kathan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vZGIJV_Q7OQ\">https://youtu.be/vZGIJV_Q7OQ</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_.28Fast_and_Easy_.E2.9A.A1.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Pi_Academy_(Fast_and_Easy_⚡🚀)\">Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Pi Academy (Fast and Easy ⚡🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared\">https://youtu.be/DIl3rLQQkQQ?feature=shared</a>\n</p><p>~ Pi Academy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GsXiQWPowoE\">https://youtu.be/GsXiQWPowoE</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mpnm_r6D3-w?t=634\">https://youtu.be/mpnm_r6D3-w?t=634</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B\">2024 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"202